# {{displayName}}

Use this skill for interactive planning requests that benefit from the bundled MCP UI.

1. Call data tools before render tools.
2. Check and refine structured data before rendering the final component.
3. Use the smallest presentation that makes the result easier to inspect or edit.
4. Require confirmation before destructive tool calls.

The tools remain useful without the component so headless workflows still work.
